  fhir:CodeSystem.description [ fhir:value "Documented monitoring routes with stable Track A and Track B codes. A route does not establish equivalent outcomes, successful contact, device availability or completed monitoring. Clinical requirements are not reduced by the route; access, preference and the supported local plan require separate documentation."] ;
